#: 7ec8f2c4ea6d4654aa8a7657c718c134
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/LoRa-LoRaWan/index.rst:2
msgid "安信可 LoRa/LoRaWan系列模块 FAQ"
msgstr "Ai-Thinker LoRa/LoRaWAN Series Module FAQ"

#: 6820412ff96740148fc3a97e4a87d50e
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/LoRa-LoRaWan/index.rst:17
msgid "Ra-01模块和Ra-02模块的区别是什么？"
msgstr "What is the difference between the Ra-01 module and the Ra-02 module?"

#: 58c91a0c315145e38b8b8135066f57c4
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/LoRa-LoRaWan/index.rst:18
msgid "答：Ra-01，Ra-02内部只有一个SX1278芯片，两者的区别就是一个天线座子（Ra-02多了一个Ipex座子）"
msgstr ""
"A: Both Ra-01 and Ra-02 have only one SX1278 chip inside. The difference "
"is the antenna connector. Ra-02 has an additional IPEX connector."

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/LoRa-LoRaWan/index.rst:21
#: a4fdb5eb54a44f49ba4d55642233e215
msgid "RHF78-052模块用OTAA入网模式失败了，显示join failed 有什么办法去定位失败原因吗?"
msgstr ""
"The RHF78-052 module failed to join the network in OTAA mode and shows "
"\"join failed\". Is there any way to locate the cause of the failure?"

#: 2207c218e03b45ecbecc094587a40351
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/LoRa-LoRaWan/index.rst:22
msgid "AT+CH=CN470 设置为该地区信道"
msgstr "Set the channel for this region with AT+CH=CN470."

#: 21d5093d8dd64055814c6c09731d6bff
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/LoRa-LoRaWan/index.rst:25
msgid "SX1278有寻址或数据加密功能吗?是不是别人的1278只要与我同频就可以收到所有数据?"
msgstr ""
"Does SX1278 support addressing or data encryption? If another SX1278 is "
"on the same frequency as mine, can it receive all my data?"

#: 22d6f646dcd24a3696572b8526c4d2be
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/LoRa-LoRaWan/index.rst:26
msgid "答：没有寻址加密，同频都可以收到。"
msgstr ""
"A: It does not support addressing or encryption. Devices on the same "
"frequency can receive the data."

#: 885fffad6eff486d93278fcf8da8c235
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/LoRa-LoRaWan/index.rst:29
msgid "LoRa模块如何进入低功耗模式（睡眠模式），低功耗模式下功耗是多少？"
msgstr ""
"How can a LoRa module enter low-power mode (sleep mode)? What is the "
"power consumption in low-power mode?"

#: 9a93398dbd2a40bc8439511a8232f56c
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/LoRa-LoRaWan/index.rst:30
msgid "通过SPI通信写寄存器的方式进入低功耗模式，低功耗模式下电流为0.2uA（微安μA）------注：此方法不适用Ra-06"
msgstr ""
"Enter low-power mode by writing registers through SPI communication. The "
"current in low-power mode is 0.2uA.  ------Note: This method does not "
"apply to Ra-06."

#: 8f3750b1692a48b19a6bee59d92e3c57
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/LoRa-LoRaWan/index.rst:33
msgid "LoRa模块上使用的是普通晶体还是TCXO石英晶体，频点为多少？"
msgstr ""
"Does the LoRa module use a normal crystal or a TCXO crystal? What is the "
"frequency?"

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/LoRa-LoRaWan/index.rst:34
#: c65362639e3c4f72951af989d51ac704
msgid "答：使用的是普通晶体，频点为32Mhz"
msgstr "A: It uses a normal crystal with a frequency of 32MHz."

#: 266817ed90b34dd9b1c68f2586ca929a
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/LoRa-LoRaWan/index.rst:37
msgid "关于SX1278射频模式切换的引脚要如何设置？"
msgstr "How should the pins for SX1278 RF mode switching be configured?"

#: 30e46df07c964a06955661ca9cb4f519
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/LoRa-LoRaWan/index.rst:38
msgid "答：LoRa模组没有射频开关芯片，不支持这样切换，直接通过SPI配置寄存器就可以使用LoRa模组"
msgstr ""
"A: The LoRa module does not have an RF switch chip and does not support "
"this type of switching. You can use the LoRa module directly by "
"configuring registers through SPI."

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/LoRa-LoRaWan/index.rst:41
#: f05cc9383511472e8cf2fabce525833d
msgid "不同的LoRa模块之间通信，可以给LoRa模块加地址吗，用来区分是哪一个LoRa模块?"
msgstr ""
"Can LoRa modules communicate with each other? Can an address be added to "
"distinguish which LoRa module it is?"

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/LoRa-LoRaWan/index.rst:42
#: ea607cb1e3544effbaf8e8bbeb3a66a0
msgid "答：可以，在有效负载的前两个字节定义为地址"
msgstr "A: Yes. You can define the first two bytes of the payload as the address."

#: 5d744e9c1f744736bb3761ff77e4a05a
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/LoRa-LoRaWan/index.rst:45
msgid "信号带宽（BW），符号速率（Rs）和数据速率（DR）间的关系是什么？"
msgstr ""
"What is the relationship between signal bandwidth (BW), symbol rate (Rs),"
" and data rate (DR)?"

#: 4cb220982e52438985da9df0298fd584
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/LoRa-LoRaWan/index.rst:46
msgid ""
"Rs=BW/(2^SF)、DR= SF*( BW/2^SF)*CR，但我们建议你使用Semtech "
"LoRa调制解调器计算器按照不同的配置选型评估数据速率和传输时间。"
msgstr ""
"Rs = BW / (2^SF), DR = SF * (BW / 2^SF) * CR. However, we recommend using"
" the Semtech LoRa Modem Calculator to evaluate the data rate and "
"transmission time according to different configurations."

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/LoRa-LoRaWan/index.rst:49
#: e656af2501364a8f9d2dffc31a037949
msgid "LoRa设备天线上可以达到的实际Tx功率是多少？"
msgstr ""
"What is the actual Tx power that can be achieved at the antenna of a LoRa"
" device?"

#: 956948c0361d4851b71088274e7a2c0c
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/LoRa-LoRaWan/index.rst:50
msgid ""
"在芯片引脚输出的功率是+20dBm，经过匹配/滤波损耗后在天线后，在天线上功  率是+19dBm "
"+/-0.5dB。最大输出功率在不同的地区有不同的规定，LoRaWAN规范定义了不同地区不同的输出功率使链路预算最大化。"
msgstr ""
"The output power at the chip pin is +20dBm. After matching/filtering "
"loss, the power at the antenna is +19dBm +/-0.5dB. The maximum output "
"power is regulated differently in different regions. The LoRaWAN "
"specification defines different output powers for different regions to "
"maximize the link budget."

#: 42c9d43bc5724fa9a16029a1f47692f4
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/LoRa-LoRaWan/index.rst:53
msgid "当两个LoRa模块不能相互通信时，故障检测的步骤是什么？"
msgstr ""
"What are the troubleshooting steps when two LoRa modules cannot "
"communicate with each other?"

#: 9fea80701a674c93bc0db9e979b36f70
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/LoRa-LoRaWan/index.rst:54
msgid "答：首先，在两个设备间检查由晶振引起的频率偏移。带宽（BW）、中心频率和数据速率这些都源自晶振频率。其次，检查在两边的软件/固件设置，确保频率、带宽、扩频因子、编码率和数据包结构是一致的。"
msgstr ""
"A: First, check the frequency offset caused by the crystal oscillator "
"between the two devices. Bandwidth (BW), center frequency, and data rate "
"are all derived from the crystal frequency. Second, check the "
"software/firmware settings on both sides to ensure that the frequency, "
"bandwidth, spreading factor, coding rate, and packet structure are "
"consistent."

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/LoRa-LoRaWan/index.rst:57
#: a1a4bbfd038246c1bc8a959cb13d6704
msgid "LoRa模块可以发送或者接受一个无限长度的有效载荷数据包吗？"
msgstr "Can a LoRa module send or receive a payload packet of unlimited length?"

#: 27f16134c6774656ab5a8b0833458e4e
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/LoRa-LoRaWan/index.rst:58
msgid "答：不可以，在LoRa发送或者接受中最大数据包长度是256个字节"
msgstr ""
"A: No. In LoRa transmission or reception, the maximum packet length is "
"256 bytes."

#: 920c319ae91e484184db356281e4eccc
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/LoRa-LoRaWan/index.rst:61
msgid "LoRa模式的有效载荷长度可以用任意数据配置为256个字节吗？"
msgstr ""
"Can the payload length in LoRa mode be configured to 256 bytes with "
"arbitrary data?"

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/LoRa-LoRaWan/index.rst:62
#: fa0b333a10c140538be0fc9a3c5d62a3
msgid ""
"答：SX127x LoRa设备在LoRa模式中有一个256字节的FIFO。理论上，所有的256字                 "
"节都可以用于TX或RX。然而，用低数据速率配置，256字节有效载荷的传输时          "
"间将会很长（几秒或更长），这对于抗衰落和高干扰环境是不好的。在大多数环境             "
"中这不是一个健壮的配置，因此建议如果想要一个使用低数据速率长的有效载荷，            那么数据包可以分成几个短的数据包。"
msgstr ""
"A: SX127x LoRa devices have a 256-byte FIFO in LoRa mode. In theory, all "
"256 bytes can be used for TX or RX. However, with a low data rate "
"configuration, the transmission time for a 256-byte payload will be very "
"long, several seconds or more, which is not good for anti-fading and "
"high-interference environments. In most environments this is not a robust"
" configuration. Therefore, if a long payload is required at a low data "
"rate, it is recommended to split the packet into several shorter packets."

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/LoRa-LoRaWan/index.rst:65
#: cfcdf30e41b64f789d4fe28d39575121
msgid "LoRa网关的容量是多少？一个网关可以连接多少个节点？"
msgstr ""
"What is the capacity of a LoRa gateway? How many nodes can one gateway "
"connect to?"

#: 537b290774b741a78b06f73c723e8a6b
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/LoRa-LoRaWan/index.rst:66
msgid ""
"答：首先最重要的是，容量是在一定时间内节接受数据包数量的一个结果。一个SX1301       "
"有8个通道，使用LoRaWAN协议每天可以接受接近150万包数据。因此，如果你的应用每小时发送一个包，那么一个SX1301网关可以处理大约62500个终端设备。"
msgstr ""
"A: Most importantly, capacity is determined by the number of packets "
"received within a certain period of time. An SX1301 has 8 channels and "
"can receive nearly 1.5 million packets per day using the LoRaWAN "
"protocol. Therefore, if your application sends one packet per hour, one "
"SX1301 gateway can handle about 62,500 end devices."

#: 49f5c72b268c483d9af00c56909124be
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/LoRa-LoRaWan/index.rst:69
msgid "如果不能达到+20dBm，如何解决输出功率问题？"
msgstr ""
"If +20dBm cannot be achieved, how should the output power issue be "
"resolved?"

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/LoRa-LoRaWan/index.rst:72
#: caa12013f9064b828d70d49ad208cfe7
msgid "答：1.请确认你连接到正确的引脚（PA_Boost）设置，20dBm输出的引脚。每个频段有两个输出端口。一个是高功率端口称为PA_boost，另一个是高效端口称为RFO。"
msgstr ""
"A: 1. Confirm that you are connected to the correct pin, PA_Boost, for "
"20dBm output. Each frequency band has two output ports. One is the high-"
"power port called PA_Boost, and the other is the high-efficiency port "
"called RFO."

#: 62b3dd9e3bbf4a8a9279c6c0954b4664
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/LoRa-LoRaWan/index.rst:71
msgid ""
"2. 然后，检测软件配置。应该正确地配置好三个寄存器：RegPaConfig、RegOcp 和 "
"RegPaDac。这意味着你在软件中应选择正确的引脚做相应的输出，再依据你需要的功耗级别设置正确的值 3. "
"确认他们与Semtech参考设计相一致以便设计一个好的PCB布局。这对于可能达到最大的输出功率来说是重要的。"
msgstr ""
"2. Then check the software configuration. Three registers should be "
"configured correctly: RegPaConfig, RegOcp, and RegPaDac. This means that "
"the correct pin should be selected in the software for the corresponding "
"output, and the correct values should be set according to the required "
"power consumption level. 3. Confirm that the design is consistent with "
"the Semtech reference design in order to achieve a good PCB layout. This "
"is important for reaching the maximum possible output power."

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/LoRa-LoRaWan/index.rst:75
#: f2aa13b1850a434b9d488e956c28f667
msgid "LoRa通信距离和什么有关？"
msgstr "What factors affect LoRa communication distance?"

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/LoRa-LoRaWan/index.rst:76
#: c9f268544ba545f2812d4ae7b363060d
msgid ""
"1，发射功率。 2，天线角度，通常天线应该相互平行。 "
"3，天线的中心频率是否与模块通讯频率匹配。每个天线都有一定的频率范围，称为带宽，在这个范围内，天线阻抗最小，效率最高，这个范围的中间最佳点即中心频率，驻波比最小。"
" "
"4，LoRa的配置参数。空中速率越高，LoRa发送数据的速率越快，但是接收灵敏度就降低了。所以要提高通讯距离，就需要适当降低空中速率。空中速率大小和扩频因子SF、带宽BW、编码率有关。空中速率与扩频因子、编码率大小反相关，与带宽正相关。例如，远距离测试时，参数可以这样设置：扩频因子:12；带宽BW:6；编码率:2，注意在低速率通讯时，开启LoRa低速率优化功能。"
" 5，程序错误。典型的是PA设置错误，LoRa 1278/1276有三个射频信号发送口，分别是RFO_LF: "
"低频率发送口，效率高；PA_BOOST: 20dBm信号放大口，安信可的Ra01,Ra02使用的是该发送口，程序里务必开启；RFO_HF: "
"高频率发送口，效率高 根据硬件原理图连接，选择相应的发送口。"
msgstr ""
"1. Transmit power. 2. Antenna angle. Usually the antennas should be "
"parallel to each other. 3. Whether the center frequency of the antenna "
"matches the communication frequency of the module. Each antenna has a "
"certain frequency range, called bandwidth. Within this range, the antenna"
" impedance is the lowest and the efficiency is the highest. The best "
"point in the middle of this range is the center frequency, where the "
"standing wave ratio is the lowest. 4. LoRa configuration parameters. The "
"higher the air data rate, the faster LoRa sends data, but the receiving "
"sensitivity decreases. Therefore, to increase communication distance, the"
" air data rate should be reduced appropriately. The air data rate is "
"related to spreading factor SF, bandwidth BW, and coding rate. The air "
"data rate is negatively correlated with the spreading factor and coding "
"rate, and positively correlated with bandwidth. For example, for long-"
"distance testing, the parameters can be set as follows: spreading factor:"
" 12; bandwidth BW: 6; coding rate: 2. Note that when communicating at a "
"low data rate, the LoRa low data rate optimization function should be "
"enabled. 5. Program errors. A typical issue is incorrect PA "
"configuration. LoRa 1278/1276 has three RF signal transmission ports: "
"RFO_LF, a low-frequency transmission port with high efficiency; PA_BOOST,"
" a 20 dBm signal amplification port, which is used by Ai-Thinker Ra-01 "
"and Ra-02 and must be enabled in the program; and RFO_HF, a high-"
"frequency transmission port with high efficiency. Select the "
"corresponding transmission port according to the hardware schematic "
"connection."

#: 3f827320f0c24426987bedfff98415a7
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/LoRa-LoRaWan/index.rst:84
msgid "Ra-01这个可以用线连单片机吗？"
