msgstr "1.5dB."

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/LoRa-LoRaWan/index.rst:112
#: badf12360eca40b78eacc8d96505a759
msgid "Ra-01模组上的晶振是多少频率的？需要这个参数"
msgstr ""
"What is the frequency of the crystal on the Ra-01 module? This parameter "
"is needed."

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/LoRa-LoRaWan/index.rst:113
#: d70a0d19aae04b0e913bc5792ae8dd9f
msgid "使用的是普通晶体，频点为32Mhz"
msgstr "It uses a normal crystal with a frequency of 32MHz."

#: 95a440f40397466daf66f32850941c56
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/LoRa-LoRaWan/index.rst:116
