msgstr "Normally it can reach 3km."

#: 6d73769d0ef049009262854a84dee001
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/LoRa-LoRaWan/index.rst:120
msgid "Ra-06可以和LoRa网关配合吗 ？RHF76-052可以吗 ？Ra06只能点对点传输"
msgstr ""
"Can Ra-06 work with a LoRa gateway? Can RHF76-052? Is Ra-06 only for "
"point-to-point transmission?"

