#: ../source/docs/software-framework/LoRa-LoRaWan/index.rst:121
msgid "不行，点对点通信，或者用一个Ra-06作为网关端开发使用"
msgstr ""
"No. It supports point-to-point communication, or one Ra-06 can be used as"
" the gateway side for development."

#: 53aced2023ff4864996c0a1bb9d18d52
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/LoRa-LoRaWan/index.rst:124
msgid "LoRa的模块有集中器的么"
msgstr "Does the LoRa module have a concentrator?"

#: 4818ad52dab24c7a9d1f78dc6a82128d
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/LoRa-LoRaWan/index.rst:125
msgid "没有 ，这个只是一个射频芯片"
msgstr "No, it's just an RF chip."

#: 8f740db0daea4ea0aae7c88ae3a3976a
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/LoRa-LoRaWan/index.rst:128
msgid "Ra-02模块与MCU通信是什么协议？"
