msgid "通信距离能加长，推荐使用棒状天线，需要专门频段的棒状天线哦，还有要注意实际的环境，如果有墙或者楼房阻挡会干扰信号。"
msgstr ""
"The communication distance can be extended. A rod antenna is recommended,"
" and it should be a rod antenna for the dedicated frequency band. Also "
"pay attention to the actual environment. Walls or buildings may block and"
" interfere with the signal."

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/LoRa-LoRaWan/index.rst:184
