" 470MHz."

#: 1c0e4814f2894e5594c1c0f0910f1822
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/LoRa-LoRaWan/index.rst:266
msgid "LoRa传输距离多远？实测多少米？待机电流多大的"
msgstr ""
"How far can LoRa transmit? What is the measured distance? What is the "
"standby current?"

