"directly to a LoRaWAN platform after receiving it?"

#: 4b834c59aa4349b88da5d3d5e2f8be37
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/LoRa-LoRaWan/index.rst:1323
msgid "该功能需要用户自行开发设计实现。"
msgstr "This function needs to be developed and implemented by the user."

#: 827074a10eb24332bd5779cee5d27f51
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/LoRa-LoRaWan/index.rst:1326
msgid "问请问Ra-02模组410M~535M不同相邻信道间隔至少多大不会互相干扰？"
msgstr ""
"For the Ra-02 module, what is the minimum spacing between adjacent "
"channels in the 410MHz–535MHz range to avoid interference?"

#: 613bd10c1c0a40dba4e030f7e1042ac6
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/LoRa-LoRaWan/index.rst:1327
msgid "至少配置的带宽的两倍。"
msgstr "At least twice the configured bandwidth."

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/LoRa-LoRaWan/index.rst:1330
#: d04e0ea9fd5d49cf98e7f8dfd3d0f74c
msgid "请问LoRa模组是否可以实现对讲机功能？"
msgstr "Can LoRa modules implement walkie-talkie functionality?"

#: 5967f5b8352945e4b51ae950301cb99c
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/LoRa-LoRaWan/index.rst:1331
msgid "不可以，数据量太大，实时性太高。"
msgstr ""
"No. The data volume is too large and the real-time requirement is too "
"high."

#: 3aaa5f5ee5e34f83bd57c16ee125365c
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/LoRa-LoRaWan/index.rst:1334
msgid "请问为何Ra-08模组烧录了CN470之后，三元组均是00？"
msgstr ""
"Why are all three LoRaWAN credentials 00 after flashing CN470 firmware to"
" the Ra-08 module?"

#: 8b1f64c7ba324524b412ae3ce31b545f
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/LoRa-LoRaWan/index.rst:1335
msgid "入网三元组需要到服务器上面申请，并通过AT指令的方式写入模组内部。"
msgstr ""
"The join credentials need to be applied for on the server and written "
"into the module via AT commands."

#: 0cac86b2a03b44cb964c369890fcd18f
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/LoRa-LoRaWan/index.rst:1338
msgid "请问Ra-02模组支持lora mesh组网么？"
msgstr "Does the Ra-02 module support LoRa Mesh networking?"

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/LoRa-LoRaWan/index.rst:1339
#: cd644805e8db4b51b2b991adae445ab9
msgid "支持，mesh组网属于应用层部分内容，要用户在MCU开发实现"
msgstr ""
"Yes. Mesh networking belongs to the application layer and must be "
"implemented by the user on the MCU."

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/LoRa-LoRaWan/index.rst:1342
#: d7cd1fe335c34520af513caabf3eb5ad
msgid "请问为何Ra-01SC驱动的时候，写数据到寄存器之后，读出来的数据始终是0xFF？"
msgstr ""
"Why does the data always read back as 0xFF after writing data to "
"registers when driving the Ra-01SC?"

#: 5ad7ff664c7f4a518364e113c302a551
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/LoRa-LoRaWan/index.rst:1343
msgid "SPI驱动有问题，需要排查一下；强烈推荐用硬件SPI驱动lora模组。"
msgstr ""
"There is a problem with the SPI driver. Please check it. It is strongly "
"recommended to use hardware SPI to drive the LoRa module."

#: 6d90b2a8504c4d54a51cb28e0add0a42
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/LoRa-LoRaWan/index.rst:1346
msgid "请问Ra-01CS模组的STM32F103C8T6工程是否编译下载好固件即可实现串口收发测试呢？"
msgstr ""
"For the Ra-01CS module STM32F103C8T6 project, can serial send/receive "
"testing be performed simply by compiling and downloading the firmware?"

#: 917df05d93ed4bd58461d73697311ad1
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/LoRa-LoRaWan/index.rst:1347
msgid "需要用户手动配置发送或接收模式。"
msgstr "The user needs to manually configure the transmit or receive mode."

#: 7c179e15a6314b9782e509e37fab963d
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/LoRa-LoRaWan/index.rst:1350
msgid "请问Ra-08模组是否只能用lorawan相关功能呢？"
msgstr "Is the Ra-08 module limited to LoRaWAN-related functions only?"

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/LoRa-LoRaWan/index.rst:1351
#: faf2d57c556e41ce8a06a65cb8c7dd47
msgid ""
"Ra-08支持二次开发，用户可根据自身需求做开发，收发等驱动都是做好了的。二次开发源码： `获取链接  <https://github.com"
"/Ai-Thinker-Open/Ai-Thinker-LoRaWAN-Ra-08.git>`__"
msgstr ""
"Ra-08 supports secondary development. Users can develop it according to "
"their own requirements. The transmit/receive drivers are already "
"provided. Secondary development source code: `Download "
"link <https://github.com/Ai-Thinker-Open/Ai-Thinker-LoRaWAN-Ra-08.git>`__"
